  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets (including the stalk!). Cut carrot into half\u0002moons. Place on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f7f5633beeeb34260e1186/step-abfed9f0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, boil the kettle. Peel potato and cut into large chunks. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook potato in boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a knife, 10-15 mins.\n• Drain and return to saucepan. Add the milk, butter and a generous pinch of salt and mash until smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f7f5633beeeb34260e1186/step-f71d2a36.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop brown onion. Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a large frying pan heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Stir in lentils, garlic, curry spice blend, masala spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Add the water, baby spinach and roasted veggies and cook until thickened, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f7f5633beeeb34260e1186/step-50626bef.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high. Transfer lentil mixture to a baking dish and top with potato mash. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill until lightly golden, 5-7 mins.\n• Divide Indian lentil cauliflower pie between plates to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f7f5633beeeb34260e1186/step-645424e9.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
